ational Public Affairs all giving him leads of five to eight points. Prediction markets put his win probability near ninety percent, and most expert raters call the race Likely Democratic, though a few lean more cautious.\n\nPappas has raised more than four times Sununu's total and has picked up bipartisan endorsements, including a former Trump-backed Republican rival. Sununu counters with substantial outside spending support and name recognition in a state that only leans Democratic by two points. The race remains competitive enough that a strong closing argument or national environment shift could narrow the margin, but the current evidence favors Pappas.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.8721, "margin": 5.76}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8221, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7959, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8661, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8028, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.837, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8746, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.8609, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.856, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.8659, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.8767, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.8474, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8665, "margin": 5.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.841, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.8206, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8623, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.8967, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.8462, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.8579, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.8632, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.8916, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.8732, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.8802, "margin": 6.8}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.